<title>INDONESIA: President Suharto's programme on Monday, Nov 4.</title>
<headline>President Suharto's programme on Monday, Nov 4.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Suharto has following programme scheduled on Monday:</p>
<p>* Opening the first meeting of the Institution for Deaf People</p>
<p>09:00 a.m. (0200 GMT)</p>
<p>* Meeting Investment Minister Sanyoto Sastrowardoyo</p>
<p>10:00 a.m. (0300 GMT)</p>
<p>* Meeting chairman of investment bank JP Morgan</p>
<p>10:30 a.m. (0330 GMT)</p>
<p>* Meeting Iran's Minister for Post and Telecommunications</p>
<p>Mohammad Gharazi 11:00 a.m. (0400 GMT)</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
